Target management commands

Usage: souc-linux-x86_64 target [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list    List all available targets
  info    Show information about a specific target
  add     Add a custom target from a JSON specification file
  create  Create a new custom target specification
  host    Show host target information
  cfg     Check target configuration predicates
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -v, --verbose  Enable verbose output
  -h, --help     Print help
